@startuml
title Recognition job state
[*] --> starting : POST /api/jobs
starting --> running : Worker started
starting --> failed : Start error
running --> completed : Exit code 0
running --> failed : Exit code nonzero
running --> stopping : Stop requested
stopping --> stopped : Worker exited
starting --> interrupted : Web restarted
running --> interrupted : Web restarted
stopping --> interrupted : Web restarted
completed --> [*]
failed --> [*]
stopped --> [*]
interrupted --> [*]
@enduml
